        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Python 3.15: (Or, How Python is Slowly Becoming Perl)]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[While this article talks about the new features of Python, it includes excellent pointers to existing features of Perl. My personal issue is echoed in the final assessment of the article. Python developers used to make fun of the Perl motto TIMTOWDI, and I used to say that There is more than one way to do it, one of them is Python. However, nowadays there are a zillion ways to do everything in Python.]]></description>
